    "1": "Outstanding / Tier-1",
    "2": "Very Good",
    "3": "Good",
    "4": "Neutral"
  },
  "known_gaps": [
    "CORE has no tier-2 stratification: core.txt lists recruiters in one flat header with no tier bands.",
    "No tier 3/4 entries: the frameworks name only Outstanding and Very Good firms. Lower tiers populate from ingest as TIER_UNKNOWN."
  ],
